OL,3,GNEWSALong queues at recycling hub
OL,4,Aprompt booking system
OL,5,
OL,6,FLong queues, congestion and traffic
OL,7,Fdelays have prompted the introduction
OL,8,Fof a booking system at a recycling
OL,9,Fdepot in Worcestershire.
OL,11,FBilford Road Household Recycling
OL,12,FCentre, in Worcester, now requires
OL,13,Fusers to book an appointment for visits
OL,14,Fat the weekend or on Mondays.
OL,16,FWorcestershire County Council said the
OL,17,Fsystem was designed "to help manage
OL,18,Fdemand, reduce congestion and make
OL,19,Fvisits quicker and more convenient".
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
