OL,3,GNEWSALong queues at recycling hub
OL,4,Aprompt booking system
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe new system lets residents book up
OL,7,Fto six visits within any 14-day period,
OL,8,Fand while bookings can be made up to
OL,9,Ftwo weeks in advance, same day bookings
OL,10,Fare possible, subject to availability.
